{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Escape from creepy and irrational enemies. Fight your fear! </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are a boy who steps into an alleyway. Gradually you notice something strange about this place. Escape from the monsters and reach the truth...!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Individualized fear situations</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Monsters attacking you in different ways, can you handle it?!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620600/extras/first.gif?t=1743632235\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> <br>Diverse level design and fast-paced development</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The speedy experience will keep you on your toes! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620600/extras/second.gif?t=1743632235\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Collector elements</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are three items in this work, and if you collect them, there may be something..</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620600/extras/ItemsImage.png?t=1743632235\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Option</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Volume, camera sensitivity, rendering settings, language (Japanese, English)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Video Distribution Guidelines</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Distribution is possible for both individuals and corporations without permission.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Monetization is only possible when using the functionality provided by the video distribution site.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We would appreciate it if you could include the name of the game in the title of your video or streaming video, or